: "15500", "image": "engenn5le17ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes,  ok ... done. Next?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Second, grab the ground coffee container and place 6 heaping tablespoons into the filter at the top.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Filter? Do I need a filter?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Yes, take one of these ones. Put it into the basket. Then, add the coffee.", "id": 3, "time": "44000", "image": "engenn5le17ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oops ... I just spilled some on the floor. I'll clean that up in a bit.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Lastly, press brew.  It should take about 10 minutes.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Can you bring me a coffee when it's ready? I'll be in the boardroom.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Absolutely! Thanks for your help.", "id": 4, "time": "62250", "image": "engenn5le17ob08re2img06.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le17ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's On-The-Job Training"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Providing Some Instructions"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about methods of communication and communication technology in common social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this leve"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this leve"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this leve"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le17ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Make/Respond to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you make and respond to requests, remember to be        polite!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Making Requests \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you \u2026<br> Would you mind \u2026<br> Would you mind if \u2026<br> I was wondering if \u2026<br> Could you \u2026<br> Do you think you <br> Can you ...<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, I'll \u2026<br> Okay.<br> Sure, I'd be glad to \u2026<br> No, not at all.<br> Yep ...<br> Yes, of course.<br> No problem.<br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you help me pick something out? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Would you  hold them in the light, please?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Giving and Understanding Instructions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Here are some examples of how you ask and give instructions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking for Instructions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Giving Instructions \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How do you (do this)?<br> How do I ... ?<br> What is the best way to ... ?<br> How do I go about it?<br> What do you suggest?<br> How do you suggest I proceed?<br> What is the first step?<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First, (you) ...<br> Then, (you) ...<br> Next, (you) ...<br> Lastly, (you) ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "technical"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that requires a special set of skills "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This coffee maker is too technical for me."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in a conversation at work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Chai tea"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a spiced black tea  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She prefers Chai tea to coffee."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to brew "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to make "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Press start to brew the coffee."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "filter "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a utensil, usually made of disposable paper. It  traps the coffee grounds to allow the liquid coffee to flow through. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The filter lets the coffee flow through."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ground "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "coffee beans that are crushed "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have to put the ground coffee in the filter."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "basket"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the plastic container that hold the filter in a coffee machine "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The filter needs to go in the basket."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a 10-12 line dialogue between two people about learning something new."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give instructions. Use the words <span class=\"italic\">first</span>, <span class=\"italic\">second</span>, <span class=\"italic\">third</span> etc. to give steps."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask and respond to requests in the dialogue."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a 10-12 line dialogue that uses instructions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my dialogue aloud to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask and respond to requests in a dialogue."}]}], "type": "sena"}